{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50706","headline":"戏赠村妇 · 张祜","name":"戏赠村妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二升酸醋瓦瓶盛，请得姑嫜十日程。\n赤黑画眉临水笑，草鞋苞脚逐风行。\n黄丝髪乱梳橑紧，青䘢裙高种掠轻。\n想得到家相见後，父娘由唤小时名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}